《Yes... Good...》

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md05/031b0020a14'>
//《ようやくわかってくれたな……景明》
《You've finally seen the light, Kageaki...》

//　……そう。
//　これでいい。

//　こうして光を受け入れさえすれば、俺はもう悩む事
//も苦しむ事もないのだ……。
  Yes... This is where I belong.

  Accepting Hikaru will free me from doubt, pain, and suffering.

  As long as I have her... nothing else matters.
